HHIISSTTOORRYY
     A aacccctt file format appeared in Version 7 AT&T UNIX.  The current record
     format was introduced on May 2007.  It is backwards compatible with the
     previous format, which is still documented in <_s_y_s_/_a_c_c_t_._h> and supported
     by lastcomm(1) and sa(8).

